flowchart TD
    Docs[In-memory Document fixtures]
    Query[Query]
    BM25[BM25 retriever]
    Embed[Ollama embeddings]
    FAISS[FAISS retriever]
    Merge[Concatenate and deduplicate]
    Rerank[CrossEncoder scores]
    Filter[Keep positive scores, top 3]
    Context[Build context with source labels]
    Model[ChatOllama Qwen]
    Parser[Pydantic JSON parser]
    Result[Answer, sources, confidence]
    Fallback[Low-confidence fallback]

    Docs --> BM25
    Docs --> FAISS
    Embed --> FAISS
    Query --> BM25
    Query --> FAISS
    BM25 --> Merge
    FAISS --> Merge
    Merge --> Rerank
    Query --> Rerank
    Rerank --> Filter
    Filter -->|Documents found| Context
    Filter -->|No documents| Fallback
    Query --> Model
    Context --> Model
    Model --> Parser
    Parser --> Result

    note1[No HyDE, query decomposition, Snowflake call, or retry loop in current code]
    note1 -.-> Merge
